"backdrop":"/joKFtmqZrpv1mTlOolLVX1y4575.jpg"},"tv:338266":{"year":1936,"title_en":"Undersea Kingdom","seasons":{"1":[{"n":1,"name":"Beneath the Ocean Floor","name_fa":"","rating":0,"runtime":25,"ov_en":"Professor Norton suspects that mysterious earthquakes originate from the lost continent of Atlantis. Lieutenant Crash Corrigan joins the professor, reporter Diana Compton and young Billy Norton on a voyage aboard a revolutionary rocket-powered submarine to investigate. Their expedition discovers a hidden world beneath the ocean.","ov_fa_tmdb":null,"ov_fa":"پروفسور نورتون گمان می‌کند زلزله‌های مرموز از قاره گمشده آتلانتیس سرچشمه می‌گیرند. ستوان کرش کوریگن همراه پروفسور، دایانا کامپتون خبرنگار و بیلی نورتون جوان سوار یک زیردریایی موشکی انقلابی می‌شوند تا تحقیق کنند. سفرشان دنیایی پنهان زیر اقیانوس را آشکار می‌کند.","imdb":null,"still":"","q":["480p"],"sz":{"480p":378221520},"fa":false},{"n":2,"name":"The Undersea City","name_fa":"","rating":0,"runtime":19,"ov_en":"The explorers venture into Atlantis and encounter the mechanical Volkites, robotic soldiers serving the ruthless Unga Khan. As the group attempts to navigate the strange landscape, Unga Khan becomes aware of their presence and orders an aerial torpedo attack against Crash and Billy.","ov_fa_tmdb":null,"ov_fa":"کاشفان وارد آتلانتیس می‌شوند و با ولکایت‌های مکانیکی، سربازان رباتی که در خدمت اونگا خان بی‌رحم هستند، روبه‌رو می‌شوند. در حالی که گروه می‌کوشد در این سرزمین عجیب راهش را پیدا کند، اونگا خان از حضورشان باخبر می‌شود و دستور حمله اژدر هوایی به کرش و بیلی را می‌دهد.","imdb":null,"still":"","q":["480p"],"sz":{"480p":360165669},"fa":false},{"n":3,"name":"Arena of Death","name_fa":"","rating":0,"runtime":19,"ov_en":"Crash and his companions become caught up in the conflict between Unga Khan's forces and the peaceful followers of Sharad. Captured and placed in deadly danger, Crash must rely on his strength and fighting skills to survive the Atlanteans' brutal arena and find a way to help his friends.","ov_fa_tmdb":null,"ov_fa":"کرش و همراهانش درگیر جنگ میان نیروهای اونگا خان و پیروان صلح‌طلب شراد می‌شوند. اسیر می‌شوند و در خطر مرگ قرار می‌گیرند؛ کرش باید به زور و مهارت جنگی‌اش تکیه کند تا از میدان وحشیانه آتلانتیسی‌ها جان سالم به در ببرد و راهی برای کمک به دوستانش پیدا کند.","imdb":null,"still":"","q":["480p"],"sz":{"480p":368763674},"fa":false},{"n":4,"name":"Revenge of the Volkites","name_fa":"","rating":0,"runtime":18,"ov_en":"The struggle against Unga Khan intensifies as the robotic Volkites and his armed followers pursue the intruders. Crash and the resistance attempt to outmanoeuvre the superior technology of their enemies, while the explorers find themselves increasingly entangled in Atlantis's civil war.","ov_fa_tmdb":null,"ov_fa":"نبرد با اونگا خان شدت می‌گیرد؛ ولکایت‌های رباتیک و پیروان مسلحش تعقیب‌کننده مزاحمان هستند. کرش و مقاومت می‌کوشند از فناوری برتر دشمنانشان پیشی بگیرند، در حالی که کاشفان بیش از پیش در جنگ داخلی آتلانتیس گرفتار می‌شوند.","imdb":null,"still":"","q":["480p"],"sz":{"480p":306811157},"fa":false},{"n":5,"name":"Prisoners of Atlantis","name_fa":"","rating":0,"runtime":18,"ov_en":"Crash and Moloch attempt to infiltrate Unga Khan's headquarters to rescue Diana, Professor Norton and Billy. Their mission becomes more dangerous when they discover that Unga Khan uses a transformation chamber to brainwash captives and turn them into obedient servants.","ov_fa_tmdb":null,"ov_fa":"کرش و مولوک می‌کوشند به مقر اونگا خان نفوذ کنند تا دایانا، پروفسور نورتون و بیلی را نجات دهند. مأموریتشان خطرناک‌تر می‌شود وقتی می‌فهمند اونگا خان با اتاق تغییر، اسیران را شست‌وشوی مغزی می‌دهد و به خدمتکارانی مطیع تبدیل می‌کند.","imdb":null,"still":"","q":["480p"],"sz":{"480p":347439946},"fa":false},{"n":6,"name":"The Juggernaut Strikes","name_fa":"","rating":0,"runtime":17,"ov_en":"Crash tries to rescue his friends from Unga Khan's stronghold, but the professor has been brainwashed and now regards the tyrant as his master. Meanwhile, Unga Khan unleashes the enormous Juggernaut tank against his enemies, forcing Crash into a desperate escape with Billy.","ov_fa_tmdb":null,"ov_fa":"کرش می‌کوشد دوستانش را از دژ اونگا خان نجات دهد، اما پروفسور شست‌وشوی مغزی شده و حالا ظالم را ارباب خود می‌داند. در همین حال، اونگا خان تانک غول‌پیکر جاگنات را علیه دشمنانش به راه می‌اندازد و کرش را وادار می‌کند با بیلی فراری ناامیدانه داشته باشد.","imdb":null,"still":"","q":["480p"],"sz":{"480p":289509060},"fa":false}]},"total_links":6,"total_bytes":2050911026,"backdrop":null},"tv:19821":{"year":1936,"title_en":"Starlight","seasons":{"1":[{"n":1,"name":"Bebe Daniels and Ben Lyon","name_fa":"","rating":0,"runtime":15,"ov_en":"","ov_fa_tmdb":null,"ov_fa":"","imdb":null,"still":"","q":["360p"],"sz":{"360p":10765159},"fa":false},{"n":2,"name":"Lisa Minghetti","name_fa":"","rating":0,"runtime":15,"ov_en":"","ov_fa_tmdb":null,"ov_fa":"","imdb":null,"still":"","q":["360p"],"sz":{"360p":10855876},"fa":false},{"n":3,"name":"Gillie Potter","name_fa":"","rating":0,"runtime":15,"ov_en":"","ov_fa_tmdb":null,"ov_fa":"","imdb":null,"still":"","q":["360p"],"sz":{"360p":12267678},"fa":false},{"n":4,"name":"Hutch","name_fa":"","rating":0,"runtime":15,"ov_en":"","ov_fa_tmdb":null,"ov_fa":"","imdb":null,"still":"","q":["360p"],"sz":{"360p":13255208},"fa":false},{"n":5,"name":"Sophie Tucker","name_fa":"","rating":0,"runtime":15,"ov_en":"","ov_fa_tmdb":null,"ov_fa":"","imdb":null,"still":"","q":["360p"],"sz":{"360p":12837908},"fa":false},{"n":7,"name":"Noni","name_fa":"","rating":0,"runtime":15,"ov_en":"","ov_fa_tmdb":null,"ov_fa":"","imdb":null,"still":"","q":["360p"],"sz":{"360p":12027763},"fa":false},{"n":8,"name":"Frances Day","name_fa":"","rating":0,"runtime":15,"ov_en":"","ov_fa_tmdb":null,"ov_fa":"","imdb":null,"still":"","q":["360p"],"sz":{"360p":12578556},"fa":false},{"n":9,"name":"Ambrose and Evelyn Dall","name_fa":"","rating":1.0,"runtime":15,"ov_en":"","ov_fa_tmdb":null,"ov_fa":"","imdb":null,"still":"","q":["360p"],"sz":{"360p":11877885},"fa":false}]},"total_links":8,